<title>USA: CCC buys 7,000 T U.S. soybean meal for Nicaragua.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 7,000 T U.S. soybean meal for Nicaragua.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 7,000 tonnes U.S. soybean meal for donation to Nicaragua.</p>
<p>The CCC, which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said the meal was bought from Archer Daniels Midland Co at $312.50 a tonne, FOB.</p>
<p>The delivery period was set for August 10-30.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
